# PLAN-1094 — the ordinary AV script mode + Python object protocol lane

Ordinary Auto `use.py` sources through the shared AV language entry with the
prepared py-bridge provider (real CPython). Every `av` check is a required run
check on the ordinary chain; the legacy 99_py_dispatch / 99_script_err
documents map to these canonical cases (migration rows in
`language/migration/legacy-map.tsv`).

## Case: nested-python-call
id: "av.parity.1094.nested-python-call"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1094"]
entry-mode: "program"

